title: Skg integrates knowledge across people
pid: ed6e9811-89a4-4fe4-b20b-3f383b5ef1aa
body: |2-
  There is already [[id:bbb730bc-7ccc-413d-832d-4b6be0eb7b9e][lots of good software]] for [[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Personal_knowledge_management][/personal/ knowledge management]]. Skg extends that model to enable /shared/ knowledge management.
